py, allowing Tylor to join due to the coming war.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/s7oE5xMFb6Is9m5ai5fZULyskUY.jpg"},{"title":"La bella vita dei pensionati","episodeNumber":2,"sourceEpisodeNumber":2,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"569","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"mal","id":"569","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"34189","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"71279","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]}],"link":"106738","synopsis":"Doing an assignment completely carefree he enters into a hostage situation, meeting Admiral Hanner, Emi, Yumi, and Commander Star.\n\nDue to insane luck while the situation escalates by both, the terrorists activating a time bomb, and the UPSF arming their weapons on the building ready to fire, Tylor resolves the situation with only two injuries, and zero fatalities.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gO0qP4OAjreEuqEcJ3Jwquk79Uf.jpg"},{"title":"La nave va, ma i dubbi restano","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"569","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"569","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"34189","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"71279","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"106739","synopsis":"For his heroics in saving Admiral Hanner, Tylor finds himself promoted, and given the position of captain aboard the battleship Soyokaze. But little does realize the Soyokaze is just a dumping ground for undesirables, and it's just a plan on the part of his superiors to get him out of their hair.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yhyQIKjpBu8oaGqnc4nupsPcTV3.jpg"},{"title":"Resa incondizionata","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"569","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"569","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"34189","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"71279","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"106740","synopsis":"The are heated battles between the Soyokaze's marines and their lone fighter pilot, so Tylor decides to try and solve the problem himself.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3gwqCn8AD1cfBTdN5YYmlkcZ159.jpg"},{"title":"Un angelo vestito di bianco","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"569","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"569","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"34189","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"71279","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"106741","synopsis":"Harumi, the new nurse on the Soyokaze, is turning a lot of male heads, including the head of Captain Tylor.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zDMXgPiOHqNAjgwS6r9IMh5Dh4N.jpg"},{"title":"La coda della coda della lucertola","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"569","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"569","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"34189","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"71279","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"106743","synopsis":"Annoyed by Tylor's recent successes, Admirals Fuji and Mifune attempt to assassinate him by giving him a bomb inside a medal.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lOOWEHHQGlo5R4pdN0m1cihIJKi.jpg"},{"title":"Un patto tra gentiluomini","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"569","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"569","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"34189","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"71279","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"106742","synopsis":"Yuriko is becoming increasinly annoyed by the male crew and their lax attitude toward regulations. She attempt to sort out the problem, but is interrupted by an attack by the Raalgons.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iSWM897EBTaf9mOJ57G5JvbNleR.jpg"},{"title":"La vita è breve, uccidi, ragazza!","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"569","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"569","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"34189","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"71279","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"106745","synopsis":"Harumi is ordered to take more drastic action in tackling Tylor. However, he captain is too occupied by the ship's beauty contest.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kSF3fbONjP6Ji5bTPA154gzzKDV.jpg"},{"title":"Ditelo con i fiori","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"569","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"569","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"34189","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"71279","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"106744","synopsis":"Tylor and the rest of the crew have been demoted. The crew therefore plead to him to appeal the high command's decision in person before a set time.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4dugV4mVKnTwWfDvJOuBarqRv2G.jpg"},{"title":"Aprire le ali e volare","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"569","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"569","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"34189","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"71279","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"106746","synopsis":"The ship's fighter pilot, Kojiro, who has a strong dislike of women, is forced to train twin sisters Emi and Yumi Hanner as pilots.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mLO06SC2f7rAp24OpXLlymdgFK2.jpg"},{"title":"Declassate e felici","episodeNumber":11,"sourceEpisodeNumber":11,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"569","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"mal","id":"569","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"34189","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"71279","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]}],"link":"106747","synopsis":"Yuriko is still annoyed by the crew's refusal to stick with the ship's regulations, especially by Kim's attitudes towards uniform.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7rLZ6rgUQ57iSPD65HQZvb04f0F.jpg"},{"title":"La notte che la Soyokaze si fermò","episodeNumber":12,"sourceEpisodeNumber":12,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"569","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"mal","id":"569","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"34189","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"71279","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[12]}],"link":"106748","synopsis":"Everyone on the Soyokaze has heard the tales of how, years ago, a former captain of the Soyokaze and his crew went mad and commited suicide while patrolling the boondocks of space.\n\nUnfortunately, the Soyokaze just happens to be patrolling the same sector of space, on the same date, at almost the same time that the original incident occured!\n\nThat can only mean one thing...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/AiuIVlwJ2ylWdasfnpfdn56cDeq.jpg"},{"title":"Strategia, tattica o nessuna delle due?","episodeNumber":13,"sourceEpisodeNumber":13,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[13]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"569","episodeNumbers":[13]},{"provider":"mal","id":"569","episodeNumbers":[13]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"34189","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[13]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"71279","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[13]}],"link":"106749","synopsis":"Raalgon admiral Donan returns to take his revenge on the Soyokaze. Tylor comes up with a plan to defeat him - sailing directly through the front lines.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/64bYWldGbP79dGUN7rjSvNxEnt5.jpg"},{"title":"L'equazione della gentilezza","episodeNumber":14,"sourceEpisodeNumber":14,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[14]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"569","episodeNumbers":[14]},{"provider":"mal","id":"569","episodeNumbers":[14]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"34189","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[14]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"71279","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[14]}],"link":"106751","synopsis":"Following their last battle, the crew of the Soyokaze face another battle with another Raalgon commander, Sia-Has.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fCLXOYEUNlhvFY5lbnkoj21AXxW.jpg"},{"title":"Germi pericolosi","episodeNumber":15,"sourceEpisodeNumber":15,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[15]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"569","episodeNumbers":[15]},{"provider":"mal","id":"569","episodeNumbers":[15]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"34189","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[15]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"71279","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[15]}],"link":"106750","synopsis":"The Raalgon order Harumi to release an engineered virus to infect the entire crew. After it is released, it is revealed that the only way to get the cure is to hand over Tylor to the Raalgons.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/v1GLw0d0Ze3pFapUt6hQn79fUIG.jpg"},{"title":"Strano amore","episodeNumber":16,"sourceEpisodeNumber":16,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[16]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"569","episodeNumbers":[16]},{"provider":"mal","id":"569","episodeNumbers":[16]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"34189","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[16]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"71279","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[16]}],"link":"106753","synopsis":"While held captive by the Raalgons, Tylor manages to escape and have a midnight feast. However, he unwittingly shares it with Empress Azalyn, leader of the Raalgon Empire. The two soon begin a relationship.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/73RJl14Xo6JjO6gYQzg6f8Oegir.jpg"},{"title":"Fuga senza giustizia","episodeNumber":17,"sourceEpisodeNumber":17,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[17]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"569","episodeNumbers":[17]},{"provider":"mal","id":"569","episodeNumbers":[17]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"34189","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[17]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"71279","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[17]}],"link":"106752","synopsis":"Back at the UPSF base the Soyokaze crew learn that Tylor has not been successful in his appeal and is to be killed. They thus plan to escape quarantine and rescue the captain.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kQMC2S0Six8Uy1PaoJpi1r6KBtA.jpg"},{"title":"Le circostanze di una confessione","episodeNumber":18,"sourceEpisodeNumber":18,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[18]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"569","episodeNumbers":[18]},{"provider":"mal","id":"569","episodeNumbers":[18]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"34189","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[18]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"71279","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[18]}],"link":"106755","synopsis":"The Soyokaze crew are now on the run from UPSF as well as being under attack by the Raalgons, but are determined to rescue Tylor, who is currently working as Azalyn's pet.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/c7R2SXlFZCQOxgDUvMd8MlhTOTk.jpg"},{"title":"La bella addormentata nel bosco","episodeNumber":19,"sourceEpisodeNumber":19,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[19]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"569","episodeNumbers":[19]},{"provider":"mal","id":"569","episodeNumbers":[19]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"34189","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[19]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"71279","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[19]}],"link":"106754","synopsis":"Tylor is injured. It is discovered that the Raalgons have implanted something in his brain and the only way to solve the problems is to synch up his brain waves with those of someone else. Yuriko volunteers, but Azalyn wants to help as well.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tVpLf4JasKHJSYTuGEzHwESS7r3.jpg"},{"title":"Mi fido di te","episodeNumber":20,"sourceEpisodeNumb